        "abstract_tsi": "Just a year after producing a map supporting the Brunswick Proprietors\u2019 claim, Thomas Johnston issued this plan supporting the position of their opponents in the Plymouth Company. The map depicts the Company\u2019s grant extending to Casco Bay and includes a long note justifying its title to the land. It also places the dispute in the broader context of Anglo-French tensions by highlighting the Company\u2019s role in establishing Forts Franckfort and Western to protect the Maine frontier from French attacks. ",
